# The install one-liner on each project's page names this site, so the command
# reads as ours and survives a repo move. Each script is an asset of that
# project's latest release, the copy that release was verified with, not the
# branch head behind GitHub's raw-file cache. Ghost's own path is Omarchy's
# package repository; its script installs the latest release ahead of it.
/icloud-notes/install.sh https://github.com/ferdousbhai/icloud-for-omarchy/releases/latest/download/install-notes.sh 302
/icloud-findmy/install.sh https://github.com/ferdousbhai/icloud-for-omarchy/releases/latest/download/install-findmy.sh 302
